  "body": "Luxury, style, and privacy – a bespoke downsizer’s dream in Orewa’s Ara Hills.\r\n\r\nLot 153, 48 Huanui Drive, Ara Hills\r\n\r\nSituated in the sought-after Ara Hills subdivision, this single-level architectural home will be built on a large site backing onto protected bush, offering maximum privacy and a serene lifestyle just a short drive from everything Orewa has to offer.\r\n\r\nDesigned with discerning downsizers in mind, this home combines elegance, functionality, and style – ticking every box for comfort and modern living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Lifestyle and Relaxation\r\n\r\n• Open-plan kitchen, living & dining: full of natural light and flowing seamlessly onto a large wrap-around deck designed to maximise the bush outlook and outdoor living\r\n• Master suite: positioned for privacy, with generous walk-in robe and ensuite\r\n• Additional bedrooms: separated for comfort and privacy\r\n\r\nPremium Fixtures & Finishes\r\n\r\nThis home will showcase the best of Stonewood Homes Classic and Luxe ranges, with attention to detail in every fixture and fitting – delivering a premium, low-maintenance home that looks and feels luxurious.\r\n\r\nWhy You’ll Love It\r\n\r\n• Large site backing onto protected bush for ultimate privacy\r\n• Single-level, stylish design perfect for downsizers\r\n• Open-plan layout ideal for entertaining or enjoying the serene bush views\r\n• Prime Ara Hills location close to Orewa’s beaches, shops, and amenities\r\n\r\nContact us today to discuss your interest and secure your bespoke Ara Hills home before construction begins, title has been issued.",
